<title>USA: GATX in talks concerning Norco terminal.</title>
<headline>GATX in talks concerning Norco terminal.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>GATX Corp said it entered into letters of  intent with TransAmerican Refining Corp and Shell Norco Refining Co,  a unit of Royal Dutch/Shell Group, concerning the sale of GATX's Norco  terminal.</p>
<p>TransAmerican and Shell would acquire separate assets of the 6.4-million  barrel petroleum and chemical terminal in Norco, La., near New Orleans,  GATX said.</p>
<p>Further terms in the negotiations were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
